<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Connection Details</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css" />

    <style>
        :root {
            --brand-orange: #DF531B;
            --brand-orange-light: #FFF8F6;
            --brand-purple: #5B2D90;
            --bg-canvas: #F4F5F8;
            --text-dark: #1E293B;
            --text-muted: #64748B;
            --card-border: #E2E8F0;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-canvas);
            color: var(--text-dark);
            font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            padding-bottom: 3rem;
        }

        /* Details Card Layout */
        .details-card {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 3rem auto 0 auto;
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .card-header-styled {
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--brand-orange-light) 0%, #FFFFFF 100%);
        }

        .section-icon-wrapper {
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background-color: rgba(223, 83, 27, 0.12);
            color: var(--brand-orange);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
        }

        /* Information Grid Display */
        .info-grid-label {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .info-grid-value {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-dark);
        }

        .notes-box {
            background-color: #F8FAFC;
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            min-height: 90px;
        }

        /* Status Badge */
        .badge-status-up {
            background-color: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.1);
            color: #15803D;
            font-weight: 700;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.2);
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        /* Action Buttons */
        .btn-custom {
            height: 44px;
            padding: 0 24px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            text-decoration: none;
            border: none;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn-primary-orange {
            background-color: var(--brand-orange);
            color: #FFFFFF;
        }

            .btn-primary-orange:hover {
                background-color: #c94614;
                color: #FFFFFF;
                transform: translateY(-2px);
                box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(223, 83, 27, 0.25);
            }

        .btn-secondary-soft {
            background-color: #F1F5F9;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
        }

            .btn-secondary-soft:hover {
                background-color: #E2E8F0;
                color: var(--text-dark);
            }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <main class="container px-3 p-100">

        <div class="details-card">

            <div class="card-header-styled d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="section-icon-wrapper">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="m-0 fs-5 fw-bold text-dark">Connection Details</h3>
                        <p class="m-0 text-muted small">Comprehensive view of network line configuration</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <span class="badge-status-up">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle"></i> Active / Up
                    </span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 p-md-5">
                <div class="row g-4">

                    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                        <div class="info-grid-label">Branch Name</div>
                        <div class="info-grid-value">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-building text-muted me-2"></i>Cairo Main Branch
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                        <div class="info-grid-label">Connection Type Name</div>
                        <div class="info-grid-value">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-diagram-project text-muted me-2"></i>Site-to-Site IPsec VPN
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                        <div class="info-grid-label">Service Provider Name</div>
                        <div class="info-grid-value">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-tower-cell text-muted me-2"></i>Vodafone Egypt
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                        <div class="info-grid-label">NID</div>
                        <div class="info-grid-value">
                            <code class="text-dark fw-bold">NID-99201-CAI</code>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                        <div class="info-grid-label">Status</div>
                        <div class="info-grid-value">Up</div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
                        <div class="info-grid-label">Created By Username</div>
                        <div class="info-grid-value">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-user text-muted me-2"></i>admin_user
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="col-12">
                        <div class="info-grid-label">Notes</div>
                        <div class="notes-box">
                            Primary fiber link configured with automatic failover to 4G LTE backup. Router SLA checks enabled every 30 seconds.
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-end gap-3 mt-5 pt-3 border-top">
                    <a href="javascript:history.back()" class="btn-custom btn-secondary-soft">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i> Back
                    </a>
                    <a href="#" class="btn-custom btn-primary-orange">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-pen-to-square"></i> Edit Connection
                    </a>
                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </main>

</body>
</html>